//// load builds a creature's base for every UnitProperty2 id from one pass over four
//// lists (genesis_prime/world_map/spawn `bases_of`): the CreatureLevel row's
//// unitPropertyValue00 to 99, and the unitPropertyMultiplier000 to 199 of a
//// Creature2ArcheType, a Creature2Difficulty and a Creature2Tier row
//// (`0x1404585c0`). Each list holds one word per column of its table's row, in
//// column order, and no value is worked out here.

